{"seg": 1, "speaker": "A", "chars": 22, "text": "你有没有发现，越重要的事我们越容易拖着不做？", "t0": 679077.553932, "t1": 679082.608974, "dur_ms": 5055.04, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:20:03", "llm_end": 679082.534051, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.32], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.3], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.34], ["s5_infer", 5002.69], ["s6_guard", 5003.33], ["s7_save_wav", 5011.63], ["s8_write_cache", 5030.84], ["s9_vram", 5031.5], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5031.51], ["l2_named_copy", 5053.58], ["l3_progress_cb", 5055.04]], "audio_ms": 4360, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 2, "speaker": "B", "chars": 25, "text": "太常见了，写论文、体检、报税，全都能拖到最后一刻。", "t0": 679082.630067, "t1": 679089.572253, "dur_ms": 6942.19, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:20:10", "llm_end": 679089.493512, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.36], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.69], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.81], ["s5_infer", 6885.83], ["s6_guard", 6886.51], ["s7_save_wav", 6894.14], ["s8_write_cache", 6914.68], ["s9_vram", 6915.36], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6915.38], ["l2_named_copy", 6940.63], ["l3_progress_cb", 6942.18]], "audio_ms": 6360, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 3, "speaker": "A", "chars": 23, "text": "那今天就来聊聊，人为什么会习惯性拖延重要的事。", "t0": 679089.592823, "t1": 679095.43053, "dur_ms": 5837.71, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:20:16", "llm_end": 679095.356098, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.12], ["s0_enter", 0.13], ["s1_load", 0.13], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.33], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.16], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.21], ["s5_infer", 5782.86], ["s6_guard", 5783.43], ["s7_save_wav", 5791.51], ["s8_write_cache", 5810.7], ["s9_vram", 5811.35], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5811.69], ["l2_named_copy", 5836.01], ["l3_progress_cb", 5837.7]], "audio_ms": 5280, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 4, "speaker": "B", "chars": 20, "text": "好，我先抛一个反常识的观点：拖延不是懒。", "t0": 679095.450903, "t1": 679102.067825, "dur_ms": 6616.92, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:20:23", "llm_end": 679101.981809, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.1], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.46], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.54], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.59], ["s5_infer", 6553.1], ["s6_guard", 6553.83], ["s7_save_wav", 6571.62], ["s8_write_cache", 6592.0], ["s9_vram", 6592.64], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6592.66], ["l2_named_copy", 6615.22], ["l3_progress_cb", 6616.92]], "audio_ms": 5880, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 5, "speaker": "A", "chars": 4, "text": "不是懒？", "t0": 679102.087834, "t1": 679104.302111, "dur_ms": 2214.28, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:20:25", "llm_end": 679104.231363, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.25], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.11], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.15], ["s5_infer", 2164.73], ["s6_guard", 2165.39], ["s7_save_wav", 2169.35], ["s8_write_cache", 2189.05], ["s9_vram", 2189.69], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 2189.7], ["l2_named_copy", 2212.91], ["l3_progress_cb", 2214.27]], "audio_ms": 1320, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 6, "speaker": "A", "chars": 5, "text": "那是什么？", "t0": 679104.322794, "t1": 679104.328525, "dur_ms": 5.73, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:20:25", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 1.1], ["l2_named_copy", 4.43], ["l3_progress_cb", 5.73]], "audio_ms": 1400, "cached": true, "ok": true}
{"seg": 7, "speaker": "A", "chars": 15, "text": "很多人会觉得自己就是自制力差。", "t0": 679104.349828, "t1": 679108.922055, "dur_ms": 4572.23, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:20:29", "llm_end": 679108.846185, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.13], ["s0_enter", 0.13], ["s1_load", 0.14], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.65], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.84], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.9], ["s5_infer", 4518.6], ["s6_guard", 4519.27], ["s7_save_wav", 4527.37], ["s8_write_cache", 4547.09], ["s9_vram", 4547.71], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4547.73], ["l2_named_copy", 4570.83], ["l3_progress_cb", 4572.22]], "audio_ms": 3720, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 8, "speaker": "B", "chars": 18, "text": "心理学里更主流的解释是情绪调节问题。", "t0": 679108.942291, "t1": 679115.963056, "dur_ms": 7020.76, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:20:36", "llm_end": 679115.885664, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.24], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.2], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.23], ["s5_infer", 6965.64], ["s6_guard", 6966.3], ["s7_save_wav", 6974.45], ["s8_write_cache", 6994.03], ["s9_vram", 6994.67], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6994.68], ["l2_named_copy", 7019.34], ["l3_progress_cb", 7020.76]], "audio_ms": 6440, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 9, "speaker": "A", "chars": 12, "text": "情绪调节，能具体说说吗？", "t0": 679115.984561, "t1": 679119.991534, "dur_ms": 4006.97, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:20:41", "llm_end": 679119.917469, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.32], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.47], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.5], ["s5_infer", 3954.2], ["s6_guard", 3954.83], ["s7_save_wav", 3962.93], ["s8_write_cache", 3981.47], ["s9_vram", 3982.13], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 3982.15], ["l2_named_copy", 4005.75], ["l3_progress_cb", 4006.97]], "audio_ms": 3280, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 10, "speaker": "B", "chars": 24, "text": "就是那件事让你不舒服，你用拖延来躲开这种不舒服。", "t0": 679120.012563, "t1": 679125.996832, "dur_ms": 5984.27, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:20:47", "llm_end": 679125.923458, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.67], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.93], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.98], ["s5_infer", 5932.91], ["s6_guard", 5933.63], ["s7_save_wav", 5939.88], ["s8_write_cache", 5958.3], ["s9_vram", 5959.02], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5959.03], ["l2_named_copy", 5982.9], ["l3_progress_cb", 5984.27]], "audio_ms": 5440, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 11, "speaker": "A", "chars": 22, "text": "所以拖延其实是在回避焦虑、害怕失败这些感受。", "t0": 679126.017234, "t1": 679132.129328, "dur_ms": 6112.09, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:20:53", "llm_end": 679132.0591, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.1], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.29], ["s3_tmpdir", 0.99], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.03], ["s5_infer", 6062.82], ["s6_guard", 6063.46], ["s7_save_wav", 6068.78], ["s8_write_cache", 6088.1], ["s9_vram", 6088.89], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6088.91], ["l2_named_copy", 6110.7], ["l3_progress_cb", 6112.09]], "audio_ms": 5680, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 12, "speaker": "B", "chars": 18, "text": "对，而且越重要的事，牵动的情绪越强。", "t0": 679132.154312, "t1": 679138.032658, "dur_ms": 5878.35, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:20:59", "llm_end": 679137.957786, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.68], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.69], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.73], ["s5_infer", 5825.41], ["s6_guard", 5826.13], ["s7_save_wav", 5834.59], ["s8_write_cache", 5853.56], ["s9_vram", 5854.51], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5854.53], ["l2_named_copy", 5876.86], ["l3_progress_cb", 5878.34]], "audio_ms": 5200, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 13, "speaker": "A", "chars": 19, "text": "这就解释了为什么小事不拖，大事反而拖。", "t0": 679138.054374, "t1": 679142.367047, "dur_ms": 4312.67, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:21:03", "llm_end": 679142.296258, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.46], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.74], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.79], ["s5_infer", 4263.54], ["s6_guard", 4264.2], ["s7_save_wav", 4269.29], ["s8_write_cache", 4287.81], ["s9_vram", 4288.44], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4288.46], ["l2_named_copy", 4311.26], ["l3_progress_cb", 4312.67]], "audio_ms": 3680, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 14, "speaker": "B", "chars": 21, "text": "没错，小事做砸了没什么，大事做砸了代价大。", "t0": 679142.388013, "t1": 679148.02933, "dur_ms": 5641.32, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:21:09", "llm_end": 679147.954705, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.62], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.74], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.78], ["s5_infer", 5588.28], ["s6_guard", 5588.94], ["s7_save_wav", 5597.24], ["s8_write_cache", 5616.2], ["s9_vram", 5617.1], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5617.12], ["l2_named_copy", 5639.84], ["l3_progress_cb", 5641.31]], "audio_ms": 5160, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 15, "speaker": "A", "chars": 15, "text": "那除了怕失败，还有别的原因吗？", "t0": 679148.051009, "t1": 679151.831141, "dur_ms": 3780.13, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:21:12", "llm_end": 679151.761565, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.1], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.63], ["s3_tmpdir", 2.0], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 2.06], ["s5_infer", 3731.3], ["s6_guard", 3732.1], ["s7_save_wav", 3736.85], ["s8_write_cache", 3756.09], ["s9_vram", 3757.07], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 3757.09], ["l2_named_copy", 3778.63], ["l3_progress_cb", 3780.13]], "audio_ms": 3000, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 16, "speaker": "B", "chars": 18, "text": "还有任务太模糊，大脑不知道从哪下手。", "t0": 679151.851564, "t1": 679157.463195, "dur_ms": 5611.63, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:21:18", "llm_end": 679157.390354, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.49], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.63], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.68], ["s5_infer", 5559.4], ["s6_guard", 5560.03], ["s7_save_wav", 5568.44], ["s8_write_cache", 5587.22], ["s9_vram", 5587.87], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5587.89], ["l2_named_copy", 5610.24], ["l3_progress_cb", 5611.63]], "audio_ms": 4920, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 17, "speaker": "A", "chars": 21, "text": "比如写一份报告，光想想就觉得是个庞然大物。", "t0": 679157.484297, "t1": 679162.766739, "dur_ms": 5282.44, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:21:23", "llm_end": 679162.696397, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.1], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.57], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.32], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.35], ["s5_infer", 5232.2], ["s6_guard", 5232.96], ["s7_save_wav", 5237.68], ["s8_write_cache", 5257.14], ["s9_vram", 5257.79], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5257.8], ["l2_named_copy", 5281.14], ["l3_progress_cb", 5282.44]], "audio_ms": 4800, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 18, "speaker": "B", "chars": 24, "text": "对，模糊的任务会让人觉得无从开始，于是先放一放。", "t0": 679162.788091, "t1": 679170.108016, "dur_ms": 7319.93, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:21:31", "llm_end": 679170.032136, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.35], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.47], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.51], ["s5_infer", 7266.09], ["s6_guard", 7266.82], ["s7_save_wav", 7275.03], ["s8_write_cache", 7294.23], ["s9_vram", 7294.9], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 7294.91], ["l2_named_copy", 7318.53], ["l3_progress_cb", 7319.92]], "audio_ms": 6960, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 19, "speaker": "A", "chars": 16, "text": "还有一点，重要的事往往反馈很慢。", "t0": 679170.128899, "t1": 679174.431705, "dur_ms": 4302.81, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:21:35", "llm_end": 679174.357169, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.46], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.38], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.42], ["s5_infer", 4250.21], ["s6_guard", 4250.96], ["s7_save_wav", 4258.95], ["s8_write_cache", 4277.53], ["s9_vram", 4278.44], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4278.45], ["l2_named_copy", 4301.42], ["l3_progress_cb", 4302.8]], "audio_ms": 3640, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 20, "speaker": "B", "chars": 23, "text": "嗯，刷手机立刻有反馈，写论文可能几周才有结果。", "t0": 679174.451906, "t1": 679181.785168, "dur_ms": 7333.26, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:21:42", "llm_end": 679181.711565, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.13], ["s1_load", 0.13], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.42], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.44], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.49], ["s5_infer", 7282.85], ["s6_guard", 7283.56], ["s7_save_wav", 7288.56], ["s8_write_cache", 7307.41], ["s9_vram", 7308.08], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 7308.1], ["l2_named_copy", 7331.5], ["l3_progress_cb", 7333.26]], "audio_ms": 6960, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 21, "speaker": "A", "chars": 19, "text": "大脑天然偏爱即时奖励，这就形成了拉扯。", "t0": 679181.805468, "t1": 679187.402078, "dur_ms": 5596.61, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:21:48", "llm_end": 679187.332662, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.36], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.36], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.41], ["s5_infer", 5548.19], ["s6_guard", 5548.84], ["s7_save_wav", 5553.32], ["s8_write_cache", 5572.49], ["s9_vram", 5573.26], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5573.27], ["l2_named_copy", 5595.09], ["l3_progress_cb", 5596.61]], "audio_ms": 5040, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 22, "speaker": "B", "chars": 22, "text": "所以拖延不是意志力弱，是大脑在做它擅长的事。", "t0": 679187.422374, "t1": 679194.434119, "dur_ms": 7011.75, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:21:55", "llm_end": 679194.358212, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.63], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.49], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.53], ["s5_infer", 6959.35], ["s6_guard", 6960.08], ["s7_save_wav", 6965.59], ["s8_write_cache", 6985.43], ["s9_vram", 6986.24], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6986.26], ["l2_named_copy", 7009.86], ["l3_progress_cb", 7011.74]], "audio_ms": 6480, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 23, "speaker": "A", "chars": 19, "text": "那问题来了，既然有这么多原因，怎么破？", "t0": 679194.455077, "t1": 679198.866095, "dur_ms": 4411.02, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:21:59", "llm_end": 679198.790359, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.1], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.26], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.05], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.09], ["s5_infer", 4357.77], ["s6_guard", 4358.41], ["s7_save_wav", 4366.7], ["s8_write_cache", 4385.6], ["s9_vram", 4386.44], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4386.46], ["l2_named_copy", 4409.42], ["l3_progress_cb", 4411.01]], "audio_ms": 3600, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 24, "speaker": "B", "chars": 16, "text": "第一个办法是把任务拆到小得可笑。", "t0": 679198.886664, "t1": 679204.171646, "dur_ms": 5284.98, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:22:05", "llm_end": 679204.10002, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.59], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.43], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.47], ["s5_infer", 5234.42], ["s6_guard", 5235.05], ["s7_save_wav", 5240.41], ["s8_write_cache", 5260.13], ["s9_vram", 5260.78], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5260.79], ["l2_named_copy", 5283.56], ["l3_progress_cb", 5284.98]], "audio_ms": 4720, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 25, "speaker": "A", "chars": 12, "text": "小得可笑，比如什么程度？", "t0": 679204.193127, "t1": 679208.587518, "dur_ms": 4394.39, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:22:09", "llm_end": 679208.511993, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.51], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.22], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.26], ["s5_infer", 4339.31], ["s6_guard", 4339.88], ["s7_save_wav", 4344.64], ["s8_write_cache", 4366.29], ["s9_vram", 4366.96], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4366.98], ["l2_named_copy", 4392.83], ["l3_progress_cb", 4394.39]], "audio_ms": 3760, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 26, "speaker": "B", "chars": 18, "text": "不是写报告，而是打开文档，写下标题。", "t0": 679208.611079, "t1": 679213.734813, "dur_ms": 5123.73, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:22:14", "llm_end": 679213.658863, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.3], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.07], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.1], ["s5_infer", 5069.87], ["s6_guard", 5070.57], ["s7_save_wav", 5078.86], ["s8_write_cache", 5098.33], ["s9_vram", 5099.09], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5099.11], ["l2_named_copy", 5122.26], ["l3_progress_cb", 5123.73]], "audio_ms": 4480, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 27, "speaker": "A", "chars": 13, "text": "这个门槛低到几乎没法拒绝。", "t0": 679213.755209, "t1": 679217.861091, "dur_ms": 4105.88, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:22:18", "llm_end": 679217.787864, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.27], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.58], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.63], ["s5_infer", 4052.71], ["s6_guard", 4053.59], ["s7_save_wav", 4061.42], ["s8_write_cache", 4081.03], ["s9_vram", 4081.78], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4082.12], ["l2_named_copy", 4104.45], ["l3_progress_cb", 4105.88]], "audio_ms": 3480, "cached": false, "ok": true}
