{"seg": 29, "speaker": "A", "chars": 7, "text": "第二个办法呢？", "t0": 679223.611001, "t1": 679226.342925, "dur_ms": 2731.92, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:22:27", "llm_end": 679226.268986, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.61], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.36], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.4], ["s5_infer", 2679.93], ["s6_guard", 2680.63], ["s7_save_wav", 2687.8], ["s8_write_cache", 2707.97], ["s9_vram", 2708.97], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 2708.98], ["l2_named_copy", 2730.67], ["l3_progress_cb", 2731.92]], "audio_ms": 1640, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 30, "speaker": "B", "chars": 20, "text": "给自己设一个很短的时间，比如只做五分钟。", "t0": 679226.363308, "t1": 679231.98115, "dur_ms": 5617.84, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:22:33", "llm_end": 679231.907817, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.37], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.63], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.67], ["s5_infer", 5563.95], ["s6_guard", 5564.57], ["s7_save_wav", 5573.17], ["s8_write_cache", 5592.46], ["s9_vram", 5593.35], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5593.36], ["l2_named_copy", 5616.27], ["l3_progress_cb", 5617.84]], "audio_ms": 4920, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 31, "speaker": "A", "chars": 11, "text": "听起来像是骗自己开始。", "t0": 679232.001716, "t1": 679236.027887, "dur_ms": 4026.17, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:22:37", "llm_end": 679235.958987, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.59], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.62], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.67], ["s5_infer", 3977.22], ["s6_guard", 3977.84], ["s7_save_wav", 3983.22], ["s8_write_cache", 4002.04], ["s9_vram", 4002.81], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4002.82], ["l2_named_copy", 4024.73], ["l3_progress_cb", 4026.17]], "audio_ms": 3040, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 32, "speaker": "B", "chars": 21, "text": "可以这么理解，关键是降低启动那一刻的阻力。", "t0": 679236.04942, "t1": 679242.445478, "dur_ms": 6396.06, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:22:43", "llm_end": 679242.374661, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.35], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.45], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.48], ["s5_infer", 6346.67], ["s6_guard", 6347.31], ["s7_save_wav", 6352.74], ["s8_write_cache", 6372.21], ["s9_vram", 6372.96], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6373.3], ["l2_named_copy", 6394.63], ["l3_progress_cb", 6396.05]], "audio_ms": 5520, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 33, "speaker": "A", "chars": 14, "text": "还有没有针对情绪层面的做法？", "t0": 679242.466202, "t1": 679246.617335, "dur_ms": 4151.13, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:22:47", "llm_end": 679246.544414, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.51], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.71], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.76], ["s5_infer", 4098.03], ["s6_guard", 4098.74], ["s7_save_wav", 4106.75], ["s8_write_cache", 4126.52], ["s9_vram", 4127.19], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4127.21], ["l2_named_copy", 4149.73], ["l3_progress_cb", 4151.13]], "audio_ms": 3400, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 34, "speaker": "B", "chars": 19, "text": "可以试着给情绪命名，承认我现在有点怕。", "t0": 679246.638974, "t1": 679268.779965, "dur_ms": 22140.99, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:23:09", "llm_end": 679268.706433, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.1], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.48], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.4], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.44], ["s5_infer", 15721.37], ["s6_guard", 22089.6], ["s7_save_wav", 22098.12], ["s8_write_cache", 22117.13], ["s9_vram", 22117.77], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 22118.07], ["l2_named_copy", 22139.56], ["l3_progress_cb", 22140.99]], "audio_ms": 5760, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 35, "speaker": "A", "chars": 11, "text": "光是承认，就能缓解吗？", "t0": 679268.800887, "t1": 679273.66423, "dur_ms": 4863.34, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:23:14", "llm_end": 679273.585883, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.46], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.23], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.29], ["s5_infer", 4807.85], ["s6_guard", 4809.57], ["s7_save_wav", 4817.66], ["s8_write_cache", 4837.83], ["s9_vram", 4838.5], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4838.84], ["l2_named_copy", 4861.96], ["l3_progress_cb", 4863.34]], "audio_ms": 3960, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 36, "speaker": "B", "chars": 20, "text": "有研究认为，命名情绪本身能降低它的强度。", "t0": 679273.685499, "t1": 679279.084586, "dur_ms": 5399.09, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:23:20", "llm_end": 679279.011136, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.83], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.65], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.69], ["s5_infer", 5344.76], ["s6_guard", 5345.43], ["s7_save_wav", 5353.57], ["s8_write_cache", 5373.74], ["s9_vram", 5374.42], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5374.44], ["l2_named_copy", 5397.65], ["l3_progress_cb", 5399.08]], "audio_ms": 4680, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 37, "speaker": "A", "chars": 12, "text": "这比一味骂自己有用多了。", "t0": 679279.108431, "t1": 679283.024524, "dur_ms": 3916.09, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:23:24", "llm_end": 679282.952889, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.1], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.26], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.22], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.26], ["s5_infer", 3863.4], ["s6_guard", 3863.94], ["s7_save_wav", 3870.74], ["s8_write_cache", 3891.48], ["s9_vram", 3892.15], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 3892.17], ["l2_named_copy", 3914.88], ["l3_progress_cb", 3916.09]], "audio_ms": 2960, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 38, "speaker": "B", "chars": 15, "text": "对，自我批评往往只会加重回避。", "t0": 679283.047202, "t1": 679287.445237, "dur_ms": 4398.03, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:23:28", "llm_end": 679287.371011, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.59], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.46], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.5], ["s5_infer", 4344.77], ["s6_guard", 4345.39], ["s7_save_wav", 4353.21], ["s8_write_cache", 4373.25], ["s9_vram", 4374.12], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4374.14], ["l2_named_copy", 4396.47], ["l3_progress_cb", 4398.03]], "audio_ms": 3520, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 39, "speaker": "A", "chars": 9, "text": "那环境要不要调整？", "t0": 679287.465755, "t1": 679290.622226, "dur_ms": 3156.47, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:23:31", "llm_end": 679290.551968, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.1], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.28], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.17], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.2], ["s5_infer", 3106.12], ["s6_guard", 3106.84], ["s7_save_wav", 3111.16], ["s8_write_cache", 3131.04], ["s9_vram", 3131.68], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 3131.7], ["l2_named_copy", 3154.95], ["l3_progress_cb", 3156.47]], "audio_ms": 2240, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 40, "speaker": "B", "chars": 20, "text": "要，把手机放远一点，比靠意志力硬扛有效。", "t0": 679290.643623, "t1": 679299.01411, "dur_ms": 8370.49, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:23:40", "llm_end": 679298.941358, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.39], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.24], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.27], ["s5_infer", 8320.36], ["s6_guard", 8321.01], ["s7_save_wav", 8325.99], ["s8_write_cache", 8344.82], ["s9_vram", 8345.5], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 8345.52], ["l2_named_copy", 8369.1], ["l3_progress_cb", 8370.48]], "audio_ms": 7640, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 41, "speaker": "A", "chars": 16, "text": "所以与其对抗自己，不如改造环境。", "t0": 679299.034604, "t1": 679304.13462, "dur_ms": 5100.02, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:23:45", "llm_end": 679304.058693, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.66], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.78], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.82], ["s5_infer", 5047.16], ["s6_guard", 5047.87], ["s7_save_wav", 5054.98], ["s8_write_cache", 5075.26], ["s9_vram", 5075.93], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5075.94], ["l2_named_copy", 5098.74], ["l3_progress_cb", 5100.01]], "audio_ms": 4360, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 42, "speaker": "B", "chars": 18, "text": "没错，让好行为更容易，让分心更麻烦。", "t0": 679304.156655, "t1": 679310.147165, "dur_ms": 5990.51, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:23:51", "llm_end": 679310.073485, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.13], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.57], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.54], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.58], ["s5_infer", 5937.79], ["s6_guard", 5938.55], ["s7_save_wav", 5946.56], ["s8_write_cache", 5965.39], ["s9_vram", 5966.08], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5966.09], ["l2_named_copy", 5988.52], ["l3_progress_cb", 5990.51]], "audio_ms": 5360, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 43, "speaker": "A", "chars": 18, "text": "不过我也想说，偶尔拖延不一定是坏事。", "t0": 679310.16824, "t1": 679315.123104, "dur_ms": 4954.86, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:23:56", "llm_end": 679315.04916, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.67], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.65], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.7], ["s5_infer", 4902.61], ["s6_guard", 4903.22], ["s7_save_wav", 4911.1], ["s8_write_cache", 4929.96], ["s9_vram", 4930.63], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4930.65], ["l2_named_copy", 4953.41], ["l3_progress_cb", 4954.86]], "audio_ms": 4120, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 44, "speaker": "B", "chars": 23, "text": "同意，有时候推迟是在等更多信息，或者需要休息。", "t0": 679315.145427, "t1": 679322.234735, "dur_ms": 7089.31, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:24:03", "llm_end": 679322.160256, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.35], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.73], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.77], ["s5_infer", 7036.66], ["s6_guard", 7037.33], ["s7_save_wav", 7042.75], ["s8_write_cache", 7062.96], ["s9_vram", 7063.65], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 7063.67], ["l2_named_copy", 7087.66], ["l3_progress_cb", 7089.3]], "audio_ms": 6240, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 45, "speaker": "A", "chars": 22, "text": "关键区别是，你是主动选择，还是被情绪推着走。", "t0": 679322.255912, "t1": 679328.871001, "dur_ms": 6615.09, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:24:09", "llm_end": 679328.796018, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.1], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.26], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.38], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.43], ["s5_infer", 6560.54], ["s6_guard", 6561.25], ["s7_save_wav", 6569.25], ["s8_write_cache", 6589.31], ["s9_vram", 6590.0], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6590.01], ["l2_named_copy", 6613.72], ["l3_progress_cb", 6615.08]], "audio_ms": 6080, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 46, "speaker": "B", "chars": 22, "text": "说得好，主动的推迟是策略，被动的拖延才伤身。", "t0": 679328.892037, "t1": 679335.449301, "dur_ms": 6557.26, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:24:16", "llm_end": 679335.373122, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.59], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.48], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.52], ["s5_infer", 6502.29], ["s6_guard", 6502.94], ["s7_save_wav", 6511.85], ["s8_write_cache", 6532.12], ["s9_vram", 6532.78], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6532.8], ["l2_named_copy", 6555.73], ["l3_progress_cb", 6557.26]], "audio_ms": 5880, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 47, "speaker": "A", "chars": 19, "text": "还有一个容易被忽略的原因，是完美主义。", "t0": 679335.469355, "t1": 679340.098829, "dur_ms": 4629.47, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:24:21", "llm_end": 679340.025974, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.13], ["s0_enter", 0.14], ["s1_load", 0.14], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.69], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.84], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.89], ["s5_infer", 4578.42], ["s6_guard", 4579.05], ["s7_save_wav", 4583.66], ["s8_write_cache", 4603.61], ["s9_vram", 4604.3], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4604.32], ["l2_named_copy", 4627.91], ["l3_progress_cb", 4629.47]], "audio_ms": 4120, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 48, "speaker": "B", "chars": 22, "text": "对，总想一次做到最好，结果连第一步都不敢迈。", "t0": 679340.119733, "t1": 679364.666021, "dur_ms": 24546.29, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:24:45", "llm_end": 679364.591007, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.12], ["s0_enter", 0.13], ["s1_load", 0.14], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.6], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.54], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.59], ["s5_infer", 18543.3], ["s6_guard", 24491.32], ["s7_save_wav", 24496.52], ["s8_write_cache", 24516.3], ["s9_vram", 24517.01], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 24517.03], ["l2_named_copy", 24544.81], ["l3_progress_cb", 24546.28]], "audio_ms": 5320, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 49, "speaker": "A", "chars": 21, "text": "允许自己先写一版烂的，反而更容易推进下去。", "t0": 679364.686763, "t1": 679370.797088, "dur_ms": 6110.33, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:24:51", "llm_end": 679370.727343, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.32], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.02], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.06], ["s5_infer", 6058.65], ["s6_guard", 6059.28], ["s7_save_wav", 6065.35], ["s8_write_cache", 6084.64], ["s9_vram", 6085.33], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6085.34], ["l2_named_copy", 6109.04], ["l3_progress_cb", 6110.32]], "audio_ms": 5560, "cached": false, "ok": true}
